decision_conditions:
Condition : 10 - The kitchen extract system should comprise a three-stage system to include a grease, pre-and carbon filter where:
a.	The duct should terminate one metre above eaves level, or one metre above any openable windows of adjacent premises whichever is the higher; 
b.	The duct should terminate pointing upwards;
c.	A cowl should be omitted and lightweight flaps or other covers, which open when the system is powered, should be fitted; and
d.	The system should be routinely serviced.
